get.description:
Return effective notification settings for the current user (read-only).

Effective = global event toggles + admin-locked overrides.
Users do not control their own preferences — all settings are admin-managed.

Response shape:
  {
    "events": {
      "<event_key>": { "email": bool, "in_app": bool, "source": str }
    },
    "digest_only": bool,
    "has_admin_overrides": bool,
  }
Source values:
  "global_disabled"  — turned off by the global admin toggle
  "admin_locked"     — explicitly set by an admin override
  "global_default"   — enabled by default (no override)
